.DS_Store

### gitlab-ci-local ###
# Per-developer local CI-simulation scratch state (cloned repo snapshots, expanded YAML, job
# output) - never source, never meant to be shared. The tool already self-excludes its own
# contents via .gitlab-ci-local/.gitignore; this just keeps the directory itself out of `git add`.
/.gitlab-ci-local/
